{
 "batchId": "b-0072",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "nl",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_587a7ecd90da6f890b71",
   "sourceHash": "587a7ecd90da6f890b7103d17581c12384d24e903ba8e8c1ef3d9052ae3ab869",
   "text": "4 vragen",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0f6413c1d4186c6bfc81",
   "sourceHash": "0f6413c1d4186c6bfc81750e762c10979dd847900b88213616e6141cf3129d34",
   "text": "Wat is Ayurveda en wat kan het voor mij betekenen?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d0acac163d1ff0407536",
   "sourceHash": "d0acac163d1ff04075365aee318c59a8196ef52c0e42e97bd69fa90c91301f72",
   "text": "Hoe kan ik Ayurvedische principes in mijn dagelijks leven toepassen?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4df96341f0c5a92c4aa0",
   "sourceHash": "4df96341f0c5a92c4aa00a8e5754fe6625ec6df953d18d1466feda28f6ebed6a",
   "text": "Sta op vóór zonsopgang en ga uiterlijk om 10 uur ’s avonds slapen",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_778cb3d407904cd47e0b",
   "sourceHash": "778cb3d407904cd47e0beb177ff52baa920786a72b807d4edeb9d4c717e58915",
   "text": "Eet bewust, met verse seizoensproducten",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_89beaccf1403393b8a19",
   "sourceHash": "89beaccf1403393b8a19449d314cbf7ef9a65dc387a5f6c1ee1bd41a40867549",
   "text": "Drink de hele dag door voldoende warm water",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4c7fd2722bf175c12fd2",
   "sourceHash": "4c7fd2722bf175c12fd2bf7606bab02aaecf922e6bb36f4a7474c8ac1016df26",
   "text": "Zorg voor rustige beweging, zoals yoga of wandelen",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0aee999add0257c4dac4",
   "sourceHash": "0aee999add0257c4dac4b1abdb6596d815f6e357eee0de68b59d84fbac0dff7f",
   "text": "Pas oil pulling en zelfmassage (abhyanga) toe met geschikte oliën",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_db9c37e4e583ef2e627c",
   "sourceHash": "db9c37e4e583ef2e627c98b3af019526fb1ba37749f45937ad2342891d6522e5",
   "text": "Stem uw voeding af op uw dominante dosha (lichaamsconstitutie)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a665646ddb31acb01209",
   "sourceHash": "a665646ddb31acb012090bd53e09267b18074105b23cb9b9fcf3fe1993aa1295",
   "text": "Onze artsen geven u tijdens uw verblijf persoonlijke aanbevelingen.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cdc7b3222cfcf68836f3",
   "sourceHash": "cdc7b3222cfcf68836f3a398b33fecf0373fe0bcd2b46987f252cc88e446450c",
   "text": "Wat zijn dosha’s en waarom zijn ze belangrijk?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9d4ec006de42f4e97c2d",
   "sourceHash": "9d4ec006de42f4e97c2d1186a167a111f0b799aa7fd6663a372e2568b0ceb311",
   "text": "Dosha’s zijn de drie lichaamsenergieën—[[OPEN_1]]Vata[[CLOSE_1]] (lucht en ruimte), [[OPEN_2]]Pitta [[CLOSE_2]](vuur en water) en [[OPEN_3]]Kapha [[CLOSE_3]](aarde en water)—die alle lichamelijke en geestelijke processen sturen. Inzicht in uw unieke dosha-samenstelling helpt bepalen welke behandelingen, voeding en leefstijlgewoonten het meest geschikt zijn voor uw constitutie. Bij Kairali voeren we bij aankomst een grondige dosha-beoordeling uit om uw programma op maat samen te stellen.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'wellness program' rendered as 'programma' (clinical register)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f1571223ecba3298a5f6",
   "sourceHash": "f1571223ecba3298a5f67e8452920d700823c1505c49741eb0d82c6eadcb2f0b",
   "text": "Zijn Ayurvedische artsen echte artsen?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_12ef40d99add8bb35fed",
   "sourceHash": "12ef40d99add8bb35fedfb44aab7d497462584c1c55b6a87b7d850bd335e5381",
   "text": "Ja. Ayurvedische artsen in India volgen een opleiding van vijfenhalf jaar tot BAMS (Bachelor of Ayurvedic Medicine and Surgery), inclusief klinische training in de Ayurvedische en de moderne medische praktijk. Velen specialiseren zich daarna nog drie jaar verder (MD in Ayurveda). De Ayurvedische geneeskunde wordt erkend door de WHO en is in India gereguleerd door het Ministry of AYUSH.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_44e23e059aece4a9315b",
   "sourceHash": "44e23e059aece4a9315b1a65d9c61453ecc847732f44b1136a69dc2e0a61230f",
   "text": "Lees meer in ons [[OPEN_1]]kenniscentrum[[CLOSE_1]].",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b1737b2b446a9c40231f",
   "sourceHash": "b1737b2b446a9c40231fed72718cdd0f62ed09c15cad46b85376ab51f07e0320",
   "text": "Behandelingen en programma’s",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8b241a7be356eef3d101",
   "sourceHash": "8b241a7be356eef3d10180a68e651b5a8f6912bd79a751ed7760a5014e97d5cf",
   "text": "5 vragen",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ce8c37570a75cfa295dc",
   "sourceHash": "ce8c37570a75cfa295dc2861b66b812c19e52c43c78b35391b19ca84c6299c99",
   "text": "Spijsverteringsstoornissen (PDS, zure reflux, obstipatie)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "IBS rendered with the Dutch abbreviation PDS (prikkelbaredarmsyndroom)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8df888f4f75068df1dcb",
   "sourceHash": "8df888f4f75068df1dcb9089700aa5fee3daff94112664b6ce70f8e3b2d87ef0",
   "text": "Aandoeningen van de luchtwegen (astma, allergieën, sinusitis)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6ae03227a543e0fc528e",
   "sourceHash": "6ae03227a543e0fc528e123276db0e4014534c062379ce598ba5dcaf3776d8db",
   "text": "Gewrichts- en spierpijn (artritis, rugpijn)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bac831d62ea3ab0612c2",
   "sourceHash": "bac831d62ea3ab0612c2aff03333fe576d3b02f27973b260c0d11b686b91fb8b",
   "text": "Stressgerelateerde klachten (angst, slapeloosheid, vermoeidheid)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6a9d60dd6130057c8400",
   "sourceHash": "6a9d60dd6130057c8400b66bd0cf7e3d50ebf14175d87b8dafdd579843cb14fb",
   "text": "Huidaandoeningen (psoriasis, eczeem, acne)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
